---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Freight Class Estimator"
  description="Terms of use for Freight Class Estimator educational freight class density estimator. Not a shipping quote."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  <div class="site-wrap prose-seo py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl tracking-tight">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-mute">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Freight Class Estimator provides educational estimates of NMFC-style freight class from shipment density.
      Results are approximate, omit many classification factors, and can become outdated when industry tables change.
    </p>
    <h2>Not classification advice or a quote</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site is legal, freight-classification, or brokerage advice. Confirm with your carrier, broker,
      or NMFTA ClassIT+ before tendering. We are not affiliated with NMFTA or any carrier.
    </p>
    <h2>Density-only estimate</h2>
    <p>
      Estimates use density alone. Stowability, handling, liability, and specific NMFC items can change class.
      Optional DIM weight is educational only; carrier factors vary.
    </p>
    <h2>Limitation</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, Freight Class Estimator and its operators are not liable for decisions made using
      these estimates. Use at your own risk.
    </p>
  </div>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
